<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_904_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260813__20260813_zNbXZZTlqv6e"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-08-13" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

